{"id":"eniosgcfna4j9yokiin77uugd","title":"卫星化学拟207亿元投资建设丙烯及高端新材料项目","originalTitle":"卫星化学：拟投资约207亿元建设丙烯及下游高端新材料项目","summary":"卫星化学与徐圩新区管委会签订协议，拟投资207亿元建设丙烯及下游高端新材料项目。项目分两期建设，一期规划100万吨丙烷脱氢（PDH）装置、30万吨丙烯酸装置、30万吨丙烯酸丁酯装置及80万吨多碳醇装置，总产能约170万吨/年。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"界面新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15322786.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T12:51:44.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T13:10:31.011Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T13:10:31.011Z","category":"stock-cn","tags":["财报","合作"],"score":72,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"e6d3396c-e133-471e-8cee-ca30ab42cbf3","title":"卫星化学拟207亿建丙烯及高端新材料项目"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"jianli@jiemian.com(界面快报)","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"e6d3396c-e133-471e-8cee-ca30ab42cbf3","title":"卫星化学拟207亿建丙烯及高端新材料项目"}],"topics":[{"slug":"earnings","name":"财报"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"frtQMgx5gdoA","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}